        <detaileddescription>
<para>When true, all map-step inferences are launched in parallel via std::async(std::launch::async). The <ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1rag_1a9da249867d949bbfd71913bb1cb7d832" kindref="member">InferenceFn</ref> callback MUST be thread-safe when this flag is set (e.g. each call uses its own HTTP connection or is backed by a thread-safe client). Defaults to false (sequential) for backwards compatibility. </para>
